                            <comment id="16596111" author="roman_s" created="Wed, 29 Aug 2018 09:13:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alexey.kosenchuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alexey.kosenchuk&quot;&gt;alexey.kosenchuk&lt;/a&gt; Thanks! I misunderstood her message then.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
